flowchart TD
    Alert[Low subnet IP headroom] --> Measure[Measure active, warm, fragmented, and reserved use]
    Measure --> Waste{Over-allocation?}
    Waste -->|Yes| Tune[Tune warm pool, node shape, rollout surge]
    Waste -->|No| Expand{Can VPC/subnets expand?}
    Expand -->|Yes| CIDR[Add CIDR/subnets and discovery]
    Expand -->|No| Strategy{Long-term design}
    Strategy --> IPv6[Adopt EKS IPv6]
    Strategy --> Custom[Use custom networking when justified]
